.TH SOLARISPKN-VERITY 1 "November 2026" "SolarisPKN" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
solarispkn-verity \- experimental userspace dm-verity Merkle CLI
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B solarispkn-verity
.RI "COMMAND [OPTIONS]"
.SH DESCRIPTION
Build, verify and inspect Merkle manifests and detached PKCS#7 root signatures.
Does not authenticate a running root filesystem or install a kernel module.
.SH COMMANDS
build, verify, audit, table, sign-root, verify-signature, doctor.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR openssl (1),
.BR veritysetup (8)
.SH AUTHORS
SolarisPKN contributors.
